<title>SWITZERLAND: Rieter offers to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Rieter offers to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss textile machinery and automotive systems maker Rieter Holding AG said in a statement its board of directors would offer to buy back registered shares from shareholders.</p>
<p>It said the terms and conditions of the buyback were contained in a separate document being mailed to shareholders and which would be made available shortly to news media.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-01-631 7340</p>
